            <div class="container-fluid ou-cards-container">
               <div class="row">
                  <div class="col-md-4">
                     <section class="section match-height ou-card-item">
                        <h2 class="text-uppercase font-weight-bold custom-text-color-5">AFFORDABLE</h2>
                        <p><img src="/images/homepage/affordable-2.jpg" alt=""></p>
                        <p>The average annual cost for Louisiana public and private 4-year colleges is $13,063.
                           Delgado costs about one-third, or $4,078 annually.</p>
                        <p><a href="/future-students/how_to_pay_for_college.aspx" class="btn btn-primary custom-btn-style-1 font-weight-semibold text-uppercase mt-sm">Pay for college</a></p>
                     </section>
                  </div>
                  <div class="col-md-4">
                     <section class="section match-height ou-card-item">
                        <h2 class="text-uppercase font-weight-bold custom-text-color-5">FLEXIBLE</h2>
                        <p><img src="/images/homepage/flexible-2.jpg" alt=""></p>
                        <p>Our learning options fit into your busy life. We offer 5 ways to attend class: Face-to-face,
                           Online, Virtual, Hybrid Face-to-face, and Hybrid Virtual.</p>
                        <p><a href="/student-services/registrar/registration-information/course-types.aspx" class="btn btn-primary custom-btn-style-1 font-weight-semibold text-uppercase mt-sm">Flexible Education</a></p>
                     </section>
                  </div>
                  <div class="col-md-4">
                     <section class="section match-height ou-card-item">
                        <h2 class="text-uppercase font-weight-bold custom-text-color-5">TRANSFERABLE</h2>
                        <p><img src="/images/homepage/transfer-2.jpg" alt=""></p>
                        <p>Many of our courses can be easily transferred to regional four year institutions...
                           and can be more a more affordable option!</p>
                        <p><a href="/academics/liberal-arts-social-sciences-education/programs/transfer.aspx" class="btn btn-primary custom-btn-style-1 font-weight-semibold text-uppercase mt-sm">Transfer &amp; Save Money</a></p>
                     </section>
                  </div>
               </div>
            </div>
            
            <section class="section section-no-border section-primary custom-section-spacement-1 m-none stats">
               <div class="container">
                  <div class="row">
